Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:39:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] lab: activar CONFIG_KEXEC en spes-perf_defconfig

Para saltar desde este kernel al kernel principal del SM6225 con su propio
DTB, sin pasar por la capa dtbo del bootloader. Depende de PM_SLEEP_SMP (y).
---
 arch/arm64/configs/vendor/spes-perf_defconfig | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/spes-perf_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/spes-perf_defconfig
index cfaa83259..b8c0e8fd2 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/spes-perf_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/spes-perf_defconfig
@@ -688,4 +688,5 @@ CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS=y
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_PREEMPT is not set
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_BUGVERBOSE is not set
 CONFIG_DEBUG_LIST=y
-CONFIG_IPC_LOGGING=y
\ No newline at end of file
+CONFIG_IPC_LOGGING=y
+CONFIG_KEXEC=y
-- 
2.53.0

